    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "1cd3d8d882181adde1d3a85126164ebe",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Native IBP reductions</strong></span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/2\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>D\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-2\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/MT\u00b2</div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>3<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/8\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-6\u00b7D\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>+8\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>+D\u00b2\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/MT\u2074</div></div><marimo-ui-element object-id='lEQa-0' random-id='9769600f-b0f6-2310-5ac6-ed454832969f'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;exact_trace_rows&#92;&quot;:0,&#92;&quot;rows&#92;&quot;:3,&#92;&quot;sectors&#92;&quot;:1,&#92;&quot;seeds&#92;&quot;:3}]&quot;' data-total-rows='1' data-total-columns='4' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Mass derivative, before and after IBP</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-4\u00b7Nc\u00b7y\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>8\u00b7MT\u00b2\u00b7Nc\u00b7y\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-4\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>D\u00b7Nc\u00b7y\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-Nc\u00b7y\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Differentiation acts on both the numerator mass and the propagator:\n$<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial m}\\frac{m}{\\Delta}\n  =\\frac{1}{\\Delta}+\\frac{2m^2}{\\Delta^2}.||)</marimo-tex>$\nThe coefficients above come from that differentiated integrand.\nThe solver reduces the doubled and tripled propagators to <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(I_1||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "PKri",
      "code_hash": "e0d7558f08cbf45fdf7d3da54dd0bc6d",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Laurent expansion and its finite rational term</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">OneLOop supplies\n$<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(A_0=m^2\\left[\\frac1\\epsilon+1-L\\right]+O(\\epsilon),\n  \\qquad L=\\log\\frac{m^2}{\\mu^2},\\quad D=4-2\\epsilon.||)</marimo-tex>$\nRecombine the exact <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(D||)</marimo-tex>-dependent coefficients with this pole before\nexpanding. This gives\n$<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(I_2=\\frac1\\epsilon-L+O(\\epsilon),\\qquad\n  I_3=-\\frac1{2m^2}+O(\\epsilon),||)</marimo-tex>$\n$<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial m}\n  =-4N_cym^2\\left[\\frac3\\epsilon+1-3L\\right]+O(\\epsilon).||)</marimo-tex>$\nSetting <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(D=4||)</marimo-tex> early would miss the <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(-2||)</marimo-tex> from\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||((3-2\\epsilon)/\\epsilon||)</marimo-tex>. The resulting finite correction is:</span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">8\u00b7MT\u00b2\u00b7Nc\u00b7y</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Finite coefficient of <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\partial T/\\partial m||)</marimo-tex></strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-4\u00b7MT\u00b2\u00b7Nc\u00b7y<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>12\u00b7MT\u00b2\u00b7Nc\u00b7y\u00b7L</div></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
